<title>JAPAN: Ryohin Keikaku falls on Nomura downgrade.</title>
<headline>Ryohin Keikaku falls on Nomura downgrade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryohin Keikaku Co Ltd's shares fell sharply on Friday morning on the over-the-counter (OTC) market after Nomura Securities Co Ltd cut the firm's rating, traders said.</p>
<p>Shares of Ryohin Keikaku, which is involved in wholesaling, retailing and original product design, stood at 8,500 yen at 0130 GMT, down 500 yen.</p>
</text>
